&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Implementation team is customer-focused, collaborative, and results-driven. Team members work closely across departments to deliver exceptional customer experiences and help brands realize value quickly. We value ownership, continuous learning, innovation, and a strong commitment to customer success while fostering an inclusive and supportive environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead onboarding and implementation projects for new customers from kickoff to go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact during the onboarding journey, building trusted customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure Yotpo solutions and guide customers through setup, integrations, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Customer Success, Product, and Technical teams to ensure a seamless implementation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive customer adoption, manage project timelines, identify risks, and ensure successful outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and English communication skills, both written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5+ years of experience in implementation, onboarding, project management, customer success, or a similar customer-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organizational skills, with the ability to manage multiple customer implementations simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SaaS platforms and guiding customers through technical or product adoption processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively across teams in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (Nice to Have):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with customer onboarding, integrations, APIs, or technical implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of digital marketing, customer retention, loyalty, reviews, or SMS marketing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant project management certifications or training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with leading eCommerce brands across the EMEA region, with a particular focus on the French market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in project management, technical consulting, and stakeholder management while partnering with customers to achieve their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global cross-functional teams in a fast-paced SaaS environment and contribute to meaningful customer outcomes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track to success – work in a dynamic organization with ambient and laid-back office atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individualized career development, rewards, and recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-life balance – 25 days paid vacation with add-ons for loyalty, regular team buildings and celebrations in and outside the country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional health insurance package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal mobility program and refer-a-friend program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a fixed monthly budget for social benefits thru Re:Benefit – a flexible online benefits solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-learning portals and knowledge sharing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company backed Hackathons, Tech conferences, workshops events, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stocked kitchen and bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity in options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about helping customers succeed, enjoy building strong relationships, and thrive in a dynamic SaaS environment, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Join Yotpo and become part of a team that values collaboration, growth, and innovation while empowering some of the world&#39;s leading eCommerce brands to achieve lasting success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ocean&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ocean is a consumer membership that makes online shopping effortless. For just $4.95/month, members get free shipping, free returns, and free package replacement, all from one unified dashboard. Our mission is to make it easier for consumers to support the amazing independent brands they desperately want to, all without having to compromise on the convenience they&#39;ve come to expect from larger retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spun out of Yotpo, we&#39;re an early-stage team building the membership layer for modern direct-to-consumer ecommerce. We&#39;ve raised a $4.5m seed round to date, led by Bessemer Venture Partners (investor in Shopify, Anthropic, LinkedIn, and many more), and we&#39;re scaling our brand network and member base quickly. You can learn more about us at&lt;a href=&quot;https://shopocean.co&quot;&gt; https://shopocean.co&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a CSM role in the traditional SaaS sense. Brands don&#39;t pay Ocean anything, so our incentives are directly aligned: the more a given brand’s customers sign up to Ocean, the more value a brand gets from Ocean, and the better Ocean does. Your job is to make that flywheel spin faster for every brand you own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll get new brands live on Ocean, show them exactly how effective it can be for their business, and then work hand-in-hand with them to get the most out of it, driving more consumer signups in the process. You&#39;ll be the person brands trust to make Ocean work for them, and the person internally who understands what brands need to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership, high-visibility role for a self-starter who&#39;s comfortable with ambiguity and rapid change, and who wants the direct, visible impact of joining a rapidly-growing company at an early stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own brand implementation. Get new brand partners live on Ocean quickly and smoothly, from initial setup through launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove the value. Show brands, with data and hands-on partnership, exactly how effective Ocean can be for their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption and expansion. Work with brands to maximize their use of Ocean&#39;s features, unlocking more value for them and more consumer signups for Ocean.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize consumer signups. Partner with brands on placement, messaging, and tactics that turn their shoppers into Ocean members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the relationship owner. Build trusted, long-term relationships with brand partners and act as their primary point of contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close the loop internally. Bring brand feedback back to the team and help shape the product and process as Ocean scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in customer success, account management, or brand partnerships, ideally in D2C, ecommerce, or SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving adoption and outcomes for partners or customers with a high degree of independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who can build trust with brand partners and translate data into a compelling story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scrappy and self-directed; you thrive with ownership and ambiguity in an early-stage environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely excited about the direct impact you can have from joining a rapidly-growing company at such an early stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Shopify or other ecommerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working directly with D2C or independent brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with lifecycle, growth, or marketing on the brand side.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Located in NYC or Boston.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the qualifications outlined above, that’s okay! We believe in hiring people, not just skills. If you have a passion to learn and are excited about eCommerce and technology, then we want to hear from you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yotpo is for everyone, and we’re committed to anti-racist work. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We welcome and employ people regardless of race, color,&amp;nbsp; gender identity, religion, genetic information, parental or pregnancy status, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer,&amp;nbsp; a place where your voice is heard and your perspective is encouraged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Come join us and help us build a global company where we&#39;re all proud to belong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Base salary $100,000-125,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In addition to base salary, this role includes a variable compensation component.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Base salary ranges are determined by multiple factors unique to each candidate, including skills and local market benchmarks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Yotpo, we&#39;re on a mission to help brands deepen their relationships with customers through data-driven experiences, AI-powered solutions, and world-class commerce technology. As we continue to scale, data plays a critical role in powering our products, enabling smarter decisions, and driving operational excellence across the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director of Data &lt;/strong&gt;to lead our evolving Data organization. This is a unique opportunity for an experienced technical leader who thrives at the intersection of leadership and execution. In this role, you&#39;ll shape the future of Yotpo&#39;s data platform and infrastructure while remaining closely connected to the technology, architecture, and innovation that drive our business forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a strategically important Data organization during a transformative phase of growth and evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the technical vision, operating model, and future direction of Data Engineering and Data Infrastructure at Yotpo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with modern data technologies, AI-driven workflows, and emerging platforms while operating at a senior leadership level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence critical company-wide initiatives and partner closely with leaders across R&amp;amp;D, Product, Finance, Support, and GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a culture that values ownership, technical excellence, continuous learning, and meaningful impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Yotpo&#39;s Data organization in its next phase, driving a lean, high-performing, and highly technical operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical vision, architecture, and execution across Data Engineering and Data Infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly manage and mentor a multidisciplinary team, fostering growth, accountability, and engineering excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strong hands-on technical leadership, guiding architectural decisions, reviewing designs, and driving execution on critical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across the organization to deliver scalable data products and platforms that support business and product needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive modernization of Yotpo&#39;s data ecosystem, balancing proven data technologies with emerging approaches in AI, automation, and modern data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic initiatives involving critical infrastructure, platforms, and investments, ensuring scalability, reliability, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best practices in data engineering, platform reliability, observability, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Data Engineering, Data Platform, Data Infrastructure, or related technical domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of engineering leadership experience, including direct people management and ownership of strategic technical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on expertise designing, building, and operating large-scale data platforms and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of modern data architectures, including data warehouses, data lakes, data pipelines, orchestration frameworks, and cloud-based platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead technical direction while remaining actively involved in architecture and implementation discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multidisciplinary engineering teams across Data Engineering, Infrastructure, Platform Engineering, or related functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills, with experience partnering across technical and business organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive cross-functional initiatives and influence outcomes in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for innovation and continuous learning, with a strong interest in AI, automation, and the future of data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (Nice to Have)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI, GenAI, LLM-based tools, or AI-assisted development workflows in engineering organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading organizational or operational transformations within data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth B2B SaaS companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with technologies such as Snowflake, Databricks, Airflow, Kafka, dbt, or similar modern data tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DataOps, platform engineering, infrastructure automation, and observability practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting business domains such as Finance, Customer Support, Revenue Operations, GTM, or Business Intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of emerging trends in AI-native engineering and next-generation data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Yotpo, we&#39;re committed to building diverse teams and creating an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work. We encourage candidates from all backgrounds and experiences to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo’s&lt;strong&gt; Enterprise Account Executives&lt;/strong&gt; are high-visibility, high-impact, competitively compensated, and integral to our continued growth strategy and expansion of our footprint within the Enterprise. From retail companies that are household names to digitally native brands, you will be targeting and working closely with high recognition names of the caliber of Chubbies, Brooklinen, and Allbirds. Given the notable nature of these brands and the corresponding opportunity for a long-term and impactful partnership, it’s necessary that whoever joins the Yotpo team approaches each point of contact carefully and strategically, with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Revenue &amp;amp; Own Results&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Outbound and strategically nurture and close leads from our Partnership division, inbound marketing initiatives, and Enterprise Sales Development Representatives. You own your results and figure out creative ways to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate at least 40% of your own pipeline needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy rigorous sales process and methodologies to maximize conversation at each stage of the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in your field with deep knowledge of Reviews, Loyalty and LLM Discoverability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively use AI tools to improve efficiency and effectiveness of the sale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive forward your own territory of account to target and access key brands identified using resources from across the Yotpo business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize Earning Potential: Go above and beyond in your sales performance, taking full advantage of an uncapped commission plan, OTE, and accelerators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailor Solutions for Customers: Introduce Yotpo’s comprehensive suite of products to new prospect accounts, focused on value based selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate Across Teams: Work closely with sales, account management, marketing, and product teams to ensure seamless solutions for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Complex Sales Cycles: Deliver maximum revenue potential by managing full, complex sales cycles, forecasting sales activity, and driving results while creating satisfied, long-term customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally, you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of quota-carrying experience, with a record of top performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years carrying a mid-market/enterprise quota at a SaaS provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience&amp;nbsp; managing quarter+ long sales cycles: you know how to navigate a complex organization, connecting with managers to C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership in all aspects of territory management and ability to leverage internal resources effectively (SDRs, Partners, Marketing, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to thrive in constantly changing, fast-paced, high-growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra kudos for marketing or entrepreneurial experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a valid UK work authorization to apply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the qualifications outlined above, that’s okay! We believe in hiring people, not just skills. If you have a passion to learn and are excited about eCommerce and technology, then we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Yotpo - UK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare with dental and optical included&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary death in service policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO, volunteer days, holidays and flex days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individualized career development, rewards and recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness and philanthropic programming and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are working in a hybrid capacity, Central London office attendance on Monday, Tuesday and Thursday each week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunches provided..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yotpo’s employee-centric culture has consistently earned us coveted spots on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.builtinnyc.com/companies/best-midsize-places-to-work-nyc-2021&quot;&gt; Built In’s&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Best Places to Work&lt;/strong&gt; lists in both NYC and Austin over the years. Directly inspired by employee feedback, we create opportunities to bring our teams together. Yotpo programming includes team events, educational fireside chats, end of year celebrations, affinity groups and partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yotpo is for everyone, and we’re committed to anti-racist work. &lt;/strong&gt;We welcome and employ people regardless of race, color,&amp;nbsp; gender identity, religion, genetic information, parental or pregnancy status, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer,&amp;nbsp; a place where your voice is heard and your perspective is encouraged. Come join us and help us build a global company where we&#39;re all proud to belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You’ll join Yotpo’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Foundation&lt;/strong&gt; group. We bring &lt;strong&gt;DevOps, FinOps, and Security&lt;/strong&gt; together under one mission, alongside our &lt;strong&gt;DevOps Club&lt;/strong&gt;: engineers from across R&amp;amp;D who train with us and build with us because they want to. What we’re building is the infrastructure foundation solid enough to power &lt;strong&gt;AIDLC&lt;/strong&gt;, the AI-driven development lifecycle every Yotpo team now ships with — and the &lt;strong&gt;agentic infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; that lets engineers and AI agents work side by side, safely, at scale&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; As a Junior DevOps Engineer, you’ll be an integral, equal member of the group having the chance to work beside seasoned experts in a friendly and open team atmosphere.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality-first culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within an engineering community that champions consistent standards, result-based decisions, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from builders:&lt;/strong&gt; Pair with Tech Leads and senior engineers who model engineering excellence and share knowledge through reviews, forums, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern toolkit:&lt;/strong&gt; Everything-as-code, GitOps, full CI/CD, deep observability — and AI assistants and agents woven into the daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real scale, real ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; World-class experts, cutting-edge cloud technologies, and production systems where your work is visible from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear growth path:&lt;/strong&gt; Structured feedback and mentorship to help you master fundamentals and take on more ownership quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify, Optimize and Modernize company’s infrastructure to support Yotpo’s ever-growing scale, owning tasks from planning through deployment and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our agentic infrastructure: the runtimes, tooling, integrations, and guardrails that let AI agents operate safely against our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in visibility — you will help us put eyes where they are missing, improving monitoring, alerting, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug applicative and infrastructure issues at scale; take part in resolving and preventing production incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate away toil: pipelines, self-service tooling, cost and reliability improvements for the engineering teams you serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code and design reviews, giving and receiving constructive feedback to raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage modern dev tools (AWS, Kubernetes, OpenTelemetry, AI assistants and agents) thoughtfully — critiquing and iterating rather than accepting output blindly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 0–2 years as a software engineer in Python, Java, Golang, or similar (internships/co-ops count). You love OOP design, design patterns, and clean code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; BSc in Computer Science — a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Working knowledge of AWS and Kubernetes, Linux, Git and networking fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on ability:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong design and troubleshooting skills — you debug in the terminal, not only in theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autodidact:&lt;/strong&gt; You are not afraid to dive deep into new technologies, including AI tooling that changes month to month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A team player with a strong sense of ownership. We win together: we do what it takes, we figure it out, we help each other — and we win, as a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (Nice to Have)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification and/or experience with AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification and/or experience with Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as code (Terraform / Terraform Cloud)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Helm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building GitOps CI/CD pipelines (ArgoCD, Argo Rollouts, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the HashiStack (Consul, Vault)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CDNs (Akamai, CloudFront)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with databases (MySQL / MongoDB / Elasticsearch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring tools (Prometheus / Grafana / Coralogix / OpenTelemetry)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in cloud cost efficiency (FinOps) or cloud security — both live inside our group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted development tools, LLM APIs, agent frameworks, or MCP-based integrations — personal projects count&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track to success – work in a dynamic organization with ambient and laid-back office atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individualized career development, rewards, and recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-life balance – 25 days paid vacation with add-ons for loyalty, regular team buildings and celebrations in and outside the country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional health insurance package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal mobility program and refer-a-friend program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a fixed monthly budget for social benefits thru Re:Benefit – a flexible online benefits solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-learning portals and knowledge sharing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-backed hackathons, Tech conferences, workshops, events, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stocked kitchen and bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid capacity (3 days in the office per week)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Yotpo, we are committed to creating secure, reliable, and innovative solutions for our customers. The Security Team is a core part of every aspect of Yotpo’s business - from customers to backend systems and everything in between. As a Junior Cloud Security Engineer, you will play an integral role equal member of a cross‑functional engineering squad, partnering with&amp;nbsp;engineers at every level and collaborating with product managers, designers, and more. Ship features that deliver AI‑driven insights, multilingual experiences, and next‑gen&amp;nbsp;loyalty capabilities for thousands of merchants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch your cybersecurity career by learning from experienced professionals while tackling real-world security challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates will immerse themselves in a complex, large-scale environment that offers the chance to work with diverse technologies. This unique setting is an exceptional opportunity for learning and growth that not every company can provide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain hands-on experience with cutting-edge cloud technologies and modern security tools in a supportive learning environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build foundational skills across multiple security domains through diverse projects and mentorship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing and maintaining cloud security controls across Yotpo’s SDLC&amp;nbsp; (AWS, Kubernetes, CI/CD pipelines, Agentic) and self-managed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in cloud security assessments, helping to identify potential security gaps and learning to recommend remediation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to vulnerability management workflows by tracking findings, supporting remediation efforts, and learning to communicate with stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to write and maintain scripts to automate routine security tasks and improve operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with DevOps, R&amp;amp;D, and Product teams to understand security and compliance requirements and help implement secure solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document security processes, configurations, and learnings to contribute to the team knowledge base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious and eager to learn about modern security tools, technologies, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Yotpo&#39;s transition into the AI era by helping secure and ensure compliance of AI agentic infrastructure (e.g., agent permissions, tool access, data flows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Cybersecurity/Information Security, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of cloud computing concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of security principles including authentication, authorization, encryption, and network security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux/Unix systems and basic command-line operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong willingness to learn and ability to quickly acquire new skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and ability to work collaboratively in a team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solving mindset with attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good written and verbal English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (Nice to Have):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, project experience or completed courses in cybersecurity, cloud computing, or DevOps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to containers and orchestration platforms (Docker, Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of Infrastructure-as-Code concepts (Terraform, CloudFormation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD concepts and tools (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in Capture The Flag (CTF) competitions, bug bounty programs, or security clubs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of security standards and frameworks (ISO, NIST, OWASP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Security Team at Yotpo thrives on risk-based thinking, vigilance, proactiveness, collaboration, and continuous learning. Every member plays a critical role in protecting our company and our customers. By fostering an atmosphere of trust and mutual respect, we empower each other to embrace challenges, share expertise, and innovate solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage all qualified candidates to apply. Join Yotpo and contribute to a culture that values security, growth, and collaboration, while making a tangible impact on our products and customers. This role is perfect for recent graduates eager to launch their cybersecurity careers in a supportive, learning-focused environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track to success – work in a dynamic organization with ambient and laid-back office atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individualized career development, rewards, and recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-life balance – 25 days paid vacation with add-ons for loyalty, regular team buildings and celebrations in and outside the country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional health insurance package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal mobility program and refer-a-friend program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a fixed monthly budget for social benefits thru Re:Benefit – a flexible online benefits solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-learning portals and knowledge sharing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company backed Hackathons, Tech conferences, workshops events, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stocked kitchen and bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity in options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the qualifications outlined above, that’s okay! We believe in hiring people, not just skills. If you have a passion to learn and are excited about eCommerce and technology, then we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help us be the best version of Yotpo by building something great together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Yotpo builds leading &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reviews &amp;amp; Loyalty&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; products for eCommerce, powered by AI and deep ecosystem integrations. We help brands turn customer voices and loyalty into measurable growth across every channel. As a Junior Software Engineer, you’ll be an integral, equal member of a cross‑functional engineering squad, partnering with engineers at every level and collaborating with product managers, designers, and more to ship features that deliver AI‑driven insights, multilingual experiences, and next‑gen loyalty capabilities for thousands of merchants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality‑first culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work within an engineering community that champions consistent standards, result-based decisions, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from builders:&lt;/strong&gt; Pair with Tech Leads and senior engineers who model engineering excellence and share knowledge through reviews, forums, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern toolkit:&lt;/strong&gt; Use current development tools (including AI‑assisted coding) and shipping practices: clean code, testing, CI/CD, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear growth path:&lt;/strong&gt; Structured feedback and mentorship to help you master fundamentals and take on more ownership quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, test, and ship user-facing features and backend services with guidance, owning tasks from planning to deployment and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and well‑tested code; add meaningful logs/metrics and concise docs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code/design reviews, giving and receiving constructive feedback to raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and data to refine scope, break work into iterations, and deliver measurable customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system health: fix bugs, reduce tech debt, and contribute to performance, reliability, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage modern dev tools (e.g., Git, CI/CD, observability, AI assistants) thoughtfully, critiquing and iterating rather than accepting output blindly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional software development (internships/co‑ops count), building web apps or cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages/Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in at least one of: TypeScript/Node.js, Java/Kotlin/C#, Python, Ruby, or Go—and/or React with TypeScript. Willingness to learn our stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foundations:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid grasp of data structures, algorithms, HTTP, REST/GraphQL, and relational databases (e.g., PostgreSQL/MySQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with Git, unit/integration testing, debugging with logs/metrics, and incremental, value‑first delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Customer‑centric, collaborative, takes ownership for outcomes, and seeks feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications (Nice to Have)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud platforms (AWS/GCP), containers (Docker), and CI/CD (GitHub Actions/Jenkins/CircleCI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event‑driven systems and messaging (Kafka/RabbitMQ/Pub/Sub); caching and NoSQL (Redis/Elasticsearch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observability/monitoring (Datadog, Prometheus, OpenTelemetry) and basic SRE practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in eCommerce, marketing tech, or SaaS at scale; familiarity with AI‑assisted development tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track to success – work in a dynamic organization with ambient and laid-back office atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individualized career development, rewards, and recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-life balance – 25 days paid vacation with add-ons for loyalty, regular team buildings and celebrations in and outside the country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional health insurance package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal mobility program and refer-a-friend program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a fixed monthly budget for social benefits thru Re:Benefit – a flexible online benefits solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-learning portals and knowledge sharing sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-backed hackathons, Tech conferences, workshops, events, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stocked kitchen and bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid capacity (3 days in the office per week)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager, EMEA&lt;/strong&gt; to lead high-impact marketing across the region. You’ll build the strategy and bring it to life through integrated campaigns, memorable events, and creative partner programs that generate demand, strengthen our brand, and help accelerate revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a visible, influential role for someone who enjoys bringing people together- whether that means launching a full-funnel campaign, creating a must-attend industry event, activating a strategic technology partner, or helping Sales turn market excitement into pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the VP of Demand Generation and work closely with teams across Sales, Partnerships, Product Marketing, Brand, Customer Success, and Marketing Operations. The ideal candidate combines strategic thinking with hands-on execution, commercial instinct, creative energy, and a natural ability to get people excited about what’s possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the EMEA marketing strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute an ambitious regional marketing plan that builds Yotpo’s presence, engages priority audiences, and drives qualified pipeline across key EMEA markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create events people genuinely want to attend.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead Yotpo-hosted events, executive dinners, roundtables, customer gatherings, trade shows, and industry conferences- from concept and audience strategy through promotion, execution, and follow-up. You’ll turn every event into an experience that creates conversation, builds relationships, and drives measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make partnerships a growth engine.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with strategic technology partners, agencies, platforms, and ecosystem leaders to create joint campaigns, co-hosted events, content, webinars, and other high-impact activations. Build programs that expand our reach, deepen relationships, and generate shared pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive integrated demand-generation campaigns.&lt;/strong&gt; Build full-funnel programs that connect digital campaigns, content, events, partners, and Sales activation—from top-of-funnel awareness through conversion and pipeline creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own execution from big idea to business result.&lt;/strong&gt; Manage campaigns and programs from brief through launch, follow-up, and analysis. Keep stakeholders aligned, remove roadblocks, and make sure great ideas actually make it into market—on time, on brand, and with real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure what matters.&lt;/strong&gt; Track and optimize program performance across registrations, attendance, engagement, MQLs, opportunities, pipeline, ACV, and ROI. Use data to improve the work while leaving room for smart creative bets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become a trusted market expert.&lt;/strong&gt; Build a deep understanding of Yotpo’s products, customers, competitors, buyer personas, partners, and regional market dynamics. Use that knowledge to spot opportunities and sharpen our positioning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a commercially minded marketer who knows how to create energy in a market and translate that energy into measurable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can see the big picture, build a clear plan, and then roll up your sleeves to make it happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You love bringing people together. You understand that the best events and partnerships aren’t one-off activities; they’re opportunities to create community, deepen relationships, and unlock revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re an excellent communicator who can align different teams, influence senior stakeholders, and make collaboration feel natural.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re highly organized and calm under pressure. You can manage multiple campaigns, partners, vendors, and deadlines without losing sight of the experience you’re creating.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You combine creativity with data. You’re excited by fresh ideas—and equally interested in understanding whether they worked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take ownership. When something needs to happen, you find the path forward and bring others with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of B2B marketing experience, ideally within SaaS, technology, or eCommerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and executing regional, field, or demand-generation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of delivering successful events, from intimate executive experiences to larger industry conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing co-marketing programs with strategic partners, agencies, platforms, or technology providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of B2B sales funnels, integrated campaigns, content marketing, and account-based marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on HubSpot experience, including email creation, audience segmentation, automation, and campaign management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional project-management skills in a fast-moving, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce and the broader marketing technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence using performance data to evaluate programs, communicate impact, and make investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The flexibility to travel across EMEA for events, partner activations, and key industry moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid UK work authorization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yotpo is for everyone, and we’re committed to anti-racist work. &lt;/strong&gt;We welcome and employ people regardless of race, color,&amp;nbsp; gender identity, religion, genetic information, parental or pregnancy status, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer,&amp;nbsp; a place where your voice is heard and your perspective is encouraged. Come join us and help us build a global company where we&#39;re all proud to belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience &amp;amp; HR Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our People team in Toronto.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll be at the heart of our Toronto office and a key member of our HR team, helping shape the day-to-day experience of employees across our two North American sites - Toronto and New York.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, people-first role that combines office management, employee experience, and HR support. You&#39;ll keep our office running smoothly, create meaningful moments that bring our teams together, and serve as the first point of contact for employees on all things HR. You&#39;ll also own the employee experience budget for our North American sites, helping ensure every investment creates a workplace where people feel supported, connected, and excited to come to work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you love creating exceptional workplace experiences and want to grow your career in HR, come help us build an employee experience people genuinely love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the employee experience budget for our North American sites (Toronto and New York), managing it thoughtfully throughout the year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute events, happy hours, holiday parties, team offsites, and celebrations that build connection and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create memorable moments across the employee lifecycle - from welcoming new hires to celebrating milestones, birthdays, and work anniversaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the New York site to ensure a consistent, high-quality employee experience across both locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day operations of our Toronto office, including food and snack orders, office supplies, and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the relationship with building management and external vendors, handling maintenance requests, deliveries, and facilities issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the office organized, welcoming, and well-stocked - a place people are excited to come to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support workplace logistics such as seating, meeting rooms, visitor experience, and office event setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first line of support for employee questions on HR policies - PTO, parental and maternity leave, health insurance, benefits, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the HR team with day-to-day operations, including onboarding and offboarding logistics, HRIS data upkeep, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help communicate HR policies and programs clearly to employees, escalating more complex cases to the right HR partner when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HR projects and initiatives across the employee lifecycle as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of experience in HR, office management, employee experience, hospitality, or a similar people-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural people person - warm, approachable, and service-oriented, with strong communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and detail-oriented, able to juggle multiple priorities and follow through on every task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, hands-on attitude - you see what needs to be done and you do it; no task is too big or too small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning events or managing budgets is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretion and good judgment when handling sensitive employee information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HR systems (e.g., HiBob) and Google Workspace is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
