&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to join Yotpo and help build the next generation of our UGC (User-Generated Content) platform, powered by AI.&lt;br&gt;This role focuses on creating AI-driven capabilities on top of Yotpo’s core products — enabling brands to better collect, understand, and activate customer content such as reviews, ratings, and visual UGC.&lt;br&gt;You will work in a strong product trio with design and engineering to discover, validate, and deliver solutions that create real value for customers and drive measurable business impact.&lt;br&gt;This is a unique opportunity to shape how AI transforms customer content into actionable insights and growth engines for e-commerce brands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering and product design in a product trio to discover and deliver impactful solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead continuous discovery with customers, prospects, and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define problems worth solving at the intersection of UGC, AI, and e-commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer and business needs into clear product direction and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive fast iteration cycles from discovery to delivery and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative and quantitative insights to inform decisions and measure outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with GTM, sales, and customer success to ensure strong product adoption and feedback loops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a domain expert in UGC, customer behavior, and AI-driven product capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–7 years of product management experience in SaaS companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working in empowered product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product discovery and delivery skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or contributing to customer-facing products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building 0→1 products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration skills with engineering, design, and GTM teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and outcome-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate in fast-moving, ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong advantage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI / LLM-based products or features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data-rich products or recommendation / insight systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in UGC, reviews, or customer engagement products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e-commerce or marketing technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency and ability to work closely with engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Why join Yotpo&lt;br&gt;You’ll join a fast-moving team building AI capabilities at the core of Yotpo’s UGC platform.&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to shape how brands turn customer content into intelligent, automated, and scalable growth engines — from insight generation to content optimization and activation.&lt;br&gt;You’ll work in an empowered product environment, collaborate with leading e-commerce brands, and build products that sit at the heart of Yotpo’s strategy.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About the Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is looking for a Senior Talent Acquisition Partner to join our People team in Tel Aviv. You&#39;ll own full-cycle recruiting for a portfolio of roles&amp;nbsp; with a strong focus on Software Engineering and Product&amp;nbsp; while also flexing to support hiring needs across Yotpo&#39;s global offices. This is a high-impact, high-autonomy role for an experienced recruiter who thrives on solving hard sourcing problems, partners confidently with senior stakeholders, and knows how to move fast without cutting corners on candidate experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting from intake through offer and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit globally as needed, supporting hiring managers and candidates across Yotpo&#39;s offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source proactively, using a mix of traditional channels and AI-powered sourcing tools (e.g., LinkedIn Recruiter, GitHub, AI/LLM-based sourcing and outreach tools) to build strong, diverse talent pipelines for hard-to-fill and niche technical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct HR and behavioral interviews, screening candidates for cultural fit, motivation, and core competencies alongside hiring managers&#39; technical evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner strategically with hiring managers and leadership, advising on market data, hiring strategy, role scoping, interview process design, and calibration, acting as a trusted talent advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive an exceptional candidate experience at every touchpoint, representing Yotpo&#39;s employer brand with professionalism and care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a full, independent desk, prioritizing across multiple open roles and stakeholders with minimal day-to-day oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to improve outcomes, tracking pipeline health, time-to-fill, and funnel metrics (via Greenhouse or similar ATS) to continuously refine process and sourcing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to employer branding and TA projects, including process improvements, and cross-functional People team initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience (in-house and/or agency), including ownership of complex, high-volume, or senior searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience hiring Software Engineering and Product profiles - comfortable evaluating technical requirements and engaging technical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting globally, across multiple countries and cultures, with a high level of spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, creative sourcing skills, including hands-on experience using AI-powered sourcing and recruiting tools to identify and engage passive candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at HR and behavioral interviewing, able to independently screen and assess candidates for fit, motivation, and competencies beyond the technical evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to influence and advise hiring managers and senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of independence and ownership, able to manage a full desk end-to-end with minimal supervision in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and data-driven mindset, comfortable using recruiting metrics and dashboards to guide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting for a B2B SaaS company — a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Greenhouse or another ATS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting hiring in the US and/or EMEA markets in addition to Israel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in employer branding, recruitment marketing, or TA operations/analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a Software Engineer, you are a core partner in the product team, shaping not just how we build, but what we build. Your mission is to solve meaningful customer problems, turn ideas into production-ready software, and leverage modern AI-native development practices to amplify your impact as an engineer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will join a culture of radical end-to-end ownership, where teams deploy to production dozens of times a day. Leveraging a modern technology stack alongside AI-powered development tools, you will build, experiment, and iterate quickly—turning complex technical challenges into products that deliver real customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Software Development:&lt;/strong&gt; AI is part of how we build software. You will leverage modern AI tools and agentic workflows as part of your daily development process to accelerate implementation, improve code quality, automate repetitive work, and explore technical solutions faster—while applying strong engineering judgment every step of the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t wait for perfect specifications. You take ideas, challenge assumptions, build prototypes when needed, iterate quickly, and turn ambiguous problems into elegant, production-ready solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Own your features from idea to production. You build it, you ship it, you monitor it, and continuously improve it—taking full ownership of both customer impact and technical quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Product Managers, Designers, and fellow engineers throughout discovery and delivery. Your technical insights will help shape product decisions before a single line of code is written.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Mindset&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Builder at Heart:&lt;/strong&gt; You love creating new things, experimenting with ideas, and turning ambiguity into working software. You proactively identify opportunities, take initiative, and enjoy solving problems that don&#39;t come with a predefined solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; You care as much about the &quot;Why&quot; (Business Value) as the &quot;How&quot; (Implementation). You understand customer problems, challenge assumptions, and make thoughtful technical decisions that maximize impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Engineer:&lt;/strong&gt; You view AI as a fundamental part of modern software development. You know how to combine AI-powered tools with strong engineering fundamentals to build better software, faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Must Haves&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software development experience building production-grade software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with modern backend and/or frontend technologies in large-scale production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning features or services from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to leverage AI-powered development tools (such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, Claude Code, or similar) as part of your daily engineering workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, testing, code reviews, and CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Product, Design, and Engineering teams in fast-paced, collaborative environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Yotpo is leading the next era of trust and loyalty in eCommerce. With AI-powered Reviews and Loyalty solutions, we help brands turn browsers into customers and customers into advocates. Through deep integrations across the eCommerce ecosystem and the trust of over 30,000 global brands, Yotpo delivers seamless omnichannel experiences that increase conversion, strengthen customer relationships, and drive profitable, long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for our first Customer Success Manager dedicated to Yotpo Discover—a strategic, hands-on operator who’s excited to help define what great looks like. This is a unique opportunity to join a new product at an early stage and build the Customer Success motion from the ground up. You’ll partner closely with Product and Sales while acting as a trusted advisor to eCommerce brands, helping them understand and improve how they appear across modern, AI-driven discovery experiences. The ideal candidate is someone with 3–5+ years of experience across Customer Success, SEO, or Growth, with hands-on SEO expertise and a track record of driving customer outcomes. You thrive in ambiguity and can translate technical concepts into clear, actionable business value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own customer relationships end-to-end—from post-onboarding through renewal—while shaping playbooks, success frameworks, and feedback loops that will scale alongside Discover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Yotpo Discover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yotpo Discover helps e-commerce brands understand and improve how they appear across AI-driven discovery experiences, including search, AI answers, and shopping assistants. As discovery expands beyond traditional search, Discover gives SEO/AEO and e-commerce teams clear visibility into performance, gaps, and opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own post-onboarding customer relationships through renewal, driving retention and expansion in close partnership with Account Managers and Customer Success teams across product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and scale the Discover Customer Success motion, including optimization frameworks, success plans, QBR templates, expansion signals, and early customer playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead SEO + AEO audits using Yotpo Discover, translating AI discovery insights into concrete recommendations and measurable outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with Product to shape roadmap direction through structured customer feedback, use cases, and validation sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic QBRs and executive-level conversations that align customer goals with Yotpo’s roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong, multi-threaded relationships across customer organizations—from day-to-day operators to C-suite stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively track adoption and performance, identifying risk early and leading resolution strategies when challenges arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years of experience in Customer Success, Account Management, SEO, Growth, or Digital Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on SEO background is a plus (agency or in-house strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable explaining AI search, LLM-driven answers, and modern discovery concepts to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder mentality—thrives in early-stage environments and excited to create structure where none exists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic advisor with experience managing complex customer relationships and engaging executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and data-driven, using insights to measure performance and demonstrate business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator and storyteller with strong presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the qualifications outlined above, that’s okay! We believe in hiring people, not just skills. If you have a passion to learn and are excited about eCommerce and technology, then we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Yotpo US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;100% coverage of employee medical premiums; 90% coverage for dependent/family premiums.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;100% coverage of employee dental + vision premiums.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive life and disability insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off (FTO) policy, sick time, and paid holidays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Equity in options.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Company sponsored 401K matching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Pre-tax Commuter and Healthcare benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive paid leave for new parents and Dependent Care FSA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Individualized career development, rewards and recognition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Wellness and philanthropic programming and events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are now working in a hybrid capacity, going into the office 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Yotpo’s employee-centric culture has consistently earned us coveted spots on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.builtinnyc.com/companies/best-midsize-places-to-work-nyc-2021&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Built In’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Best Places to Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; lists in both NYC and Austin over the years. Directly inspired by employee feedback, we create opportunities to bring our teams together. Yotpo programming includes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;team events, educational fireside chats, end of year celebrations,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; affinity groups and partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yotpo is for everyone, and we’re committed to anti-racist work. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We welcome and employ people regardless of race, color,&amp;nbsp; gender identity, religion, genetic information, parental or pregnancy status, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status. We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer,&amp;nbsp; a place where your voice is heard and your perspective is encouraged.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Come join us and help us build a global company where we&#39;re all proud to belong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Base salary $105,000-130,000&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In addition to base salary, this role includes a variable compensation component.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Base salary ranges are determined by multiple factors unique to each candidate, including skills and local market benchmarks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Artificial Intelligence (AI) Disclosure&lt;br&gt;If AI is used to screen, assess, or select applicants, employers must disclose this in the publicly advertised job posting. “AI” is broadly defined to mean “a machine-based system that, for explicit or implicit objectives, infers from the input it receives in order to generate outputs such as predictions, content, recommendations or decisions that can influence physical or virtual environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

